---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="AI Dev Handbook // ai-dev.pbeta.dev"
  description="AI 辅助生产级软件开发的工程化方法论：理论有调研，实践有 SOP"
  showSidebar={false}
  showToc={false}
>
  <!-- Status bar -->
  <div class="statusbar">
    <span class="sb-item sb-dot sb-green"></span>
    <span class="sb-item">~/projects/ai-dev-handbook</span>
    <span class="sb-item sb-sep">·</span>
    <span class="sb-item">v2.0</span>
    <span class="sb-item sb-sep">·</span>
    <span class="sb-item">42 pages</span>
    <span class="sb-item sb-sep">·</span>
    <span class="sb-item">last commit: 2026-07-07</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Terminal hero -->
  <section class="terminal-hero">
    <div class="terminal-header">
      <span class="term-dot term-red"></span>
      <span class="term-dot term-yellow"></span>
      <span class="term-dot term-green"></span>
      <span class="term-title">ai-dev-handbook — bash — 120×40</span>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <div class="term-line">
        <span class="term-prompt">$</span>
        <span class="term-cmd">cat ./README.md | head</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="ascii-art">{`
 █████   ██  ██ ██████  ███████  ██    ██ 
██   ██  ██  ██ ██   ██ ██       ██    ██ 
███████  ███████ ██   ██ █████    ██    ██ 
██   ██  ██  ██ ██   ██ ██       ██ ▄▄ ██ 
██   ██  ██  ██ ██████  ███████  ██████  
                                   ▀▀     
      Dev Handbook · v2.0 · 42 pages
`}</pre>
      <div class="term-line">
        <span class="term-prompt">$</span>
        <span class="term-cmd">echo "AI 辅助生产级开发的工程化方法论"</span>
      </div>
      <div class="term-line term-output">
        AI 辅助生产级开发的工程化方法论
      </div>
      <div class="term-line">
        <span class="term-prompt">$</span>
        <span class="term-cmd">./start.sh</span>
      </div>
      <div class="term-output">
        <div class="term-log">[<span class="log-ok">✓</span>] foundations/    loaded (8 papers, 4 cases)</div>
        <div class="term-log">[<span class="log-ok">✓</span>] methods/        loaded (11 protocols, 13 fields)</div>
        <div class="term-log">[<span class="log-ok">✓</span>] scenarios/      loaded (6 real-world cases)</div>
        <div class="term-log">[<span class="log-ok">✓</span>] toolkit/        loaded (9 templates)</div>
        <div class="term-log">[<span class="log-warn">!</span>] strategy/      loaded (4 playbooks + 3 lessons)</div>
        <div class="term-log term-em">[<span class="log-ok">→</span>] ready. navigate: <a href="#pyramid">see pyramid</a> · <a href="#paths">see paths</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pyramid / Tree -->
  <section class="section" id="pyramid">
    <h2 class="sec-h2"><span class="sec-bracket">[</span> tree --depth=3 ./handbook <span class="sec-bracket">]</span></h2>
    <pre class="tree-view">{`./handbook
├── 🌍 Why & Mindset             ─┐
│   ├── ai-as-amplifier          │  「判断力是 AI 产出的乘数因子」
│   ├── why                      │  「为什么需要这套流程」
│   └── landscape                │  「行业全景图」
│                                │
├── 📐 Foundations               ─┤  理论：是什么、为什么有效
│   ├── vibe-vs-spec             │
│   ├── context-engineering      │
│   ├── ai-boundaries            │
│   ├── quality-metrics          │
│   ├── security                 │
│   └── hard-data                │
│                                │
├── 🌐 Strategy                  ─┤  战略：要不要做、怎么做
│   ├── pilot-playbook           │  「试点负责人 Playbook」
│   ├── pilot-lessons            │  「试点踩坑实录」
│   ├── transformation           │
│   └── infrastructure-impact    │
│                                │
├── 🛠️ Methods                   ─┤  方法：怎么做（流程化）
│   ├── workflow                 │  「6 步工作流」
│   ├── spec-format              │
│   ├── clarification            │
│   ├── lint-protocol            │
│   ├── anti-patterns            │
│   ├── first-task-sop           │
│   └── ...                      │
│                                │
├── 🎯 Scenarios                 ─┤  场景：不同情境下的具体做法
│   ├── unfamiliar-codebase      │  「不熟项目 + AI」
│   ├── parallel-sessions        │  「多会话并行」
│   ├── time-management          │
│   ├── async-nightly            │  「夜间异步执行」
│   ├── docs-sync-strategy       │
│   └── team-roles               │
│                                │
└── 📦 Toolkit                   ─┘  工具：拿来即用
    ├── spec/        lint-prompts/
    ├── checklist/   circuit-breaker/
    ├── constitution/  contract/
    └── task-card/   system-prompt/
`}</pre>
    <p class="tree-hint"># 42 files · structured as 5-layer pyramid · 4 reading paths</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Core insights as numbered log lines -->
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="sec-h2"><span class="sec-bracket">[</span> insights --top=8 <span class="sec-bracket">]</span></h2>
    <div class="insights-grid">
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">01</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">core</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>AI 是放大器，不是工程师。</strong>
          <p>输入模糊 → 快速产出模糊。输入清晰 → 高效产出正确。Spec 是流程中唯一可由人完全控制的变量。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">02</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">core</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>Vibe 和 Spec 不是二选一。</strong>
          <p>原型探索用 vibe，生产交付用 spec。区分场景比争论方法更重要。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">03</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">data</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>写 Spec 占总时间的 30-50%。</strong>
          <p>Spec 写得好的项目，返工率降低 70%+，移植成功率提升 3-5 倍。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">04</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">core</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>2026 核心竞争力：上下文工程。</strong>
          <p>给 AI 提供什么上下文（AGENTS.md、Repo Map、MCP），比 prompt 本身更能决定代码质量。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">05</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">data</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>AI 代码长期维护成本被低估。</strong>
          <p>实证：AI 代码 churn rate 达人工代码的 1.5 倍。Code review 在 AI 时代不是缩水，而是加严。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">06</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">scout</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>不熟项目：AI 是侦察兵不是将军。</strong>
          <p>人先建心智地图（2-4h），AI 才能当工具。三阶段渐进信任：考古 → 侦察 → 协作。不许跳级。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">07</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">flow</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>Files ARE the State。</strong>
          <p>离开电脑前最后 1 分钟，所有判断写到 TASK_STATE.md。第二天靠文件接续，省 80% 重新对齐时间。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <div class="ic-header">
          <span class="ic-num">08</span>
          <span class="ic-tag">infra</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ic-body">
          <strong>公司 AI 基础设施决定团队上限。</strong>
          <p>并行数量瓶颈是 TPS 配额，不是 session 本身。同步对话独占 TPS、异步任务高并发、评审必须强模型。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reading paths as CLI -->
  <section class="section" id="paths">
    <h2 class="sec-h2"><span class="sec-bracket">[</span> ./read --role=&lt;who&gt; <span class="sec-bracket">]</span></h2>
    <div class="paths">
      <div class="path">
        <div class="path-prompt"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> ./read --role=pilot-lead</div>
        <div class="path-flow">
          <a href="/strategy/pilot-playbook">pilot-playbook</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/research/hard-data">hard-data</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/ai-as-amplifier">ai-as-amplifier</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/first-task-sop">first-task-sop</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/anti-patterns">anti-patterns</a>
        </div>
        <div class="path-tag"># 试点负责人</div>
      </div>

      <div class="path">
        <div class="path-prompt"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> ./read --role=engineer</div>
        <div class="path-flow">
          <a href="/handbook/ai-as-amplifier">ai-as-amplifier</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/research/ai-boundaries">ai-boundaries</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/first-task-sop">first-task-sop</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/spec-format">spec-format</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/anti-patterns">anti-patterns</a>
        </div>
        <div class="path-tag"># 工程师（刚接触 AI 编程）</div>
      </div>

      <div class="path">
        <div class="path-prompt"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> ./read --role=tech-lead</div>
        <div class="path-flow">
          <a href="/research/landscape">landscape</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/research/vibe-vs-spec">vibe-vs-spec</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/strategy/pilot-playbook">pilot-playbook</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/research/transformation">transformation</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/constitution">constitution</a>
        </div>
        <div class="path-tag"># 技术负责人 / 架构师</div>
      </div>

      <div class="path">
        <div class="path-prompt"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> ./read --role=migrator</div>
        <div class="path-flow">
          <a href="/handbook/unfamiliar-codebase">unfamiliar-codebase</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/research/ai-boundaries">ai-boundaries</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/parallel-sessions">parallel-sessions</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/async-nightly">async-nightly</a>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
          <a href="/handbook/docs-sync-strategy">docs-sync-strategy</a>
        </div>
        <div class="path-tag"># 不熟项目，需要迁移/重构</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's new -->
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="sec-h2"><span class="sec-bracket">[</span> git log --oneline -5 <span class="sec-bracket">]</span></h2>
    <div class="changelog">
      <div class="cl-item">
        <span class="cl-hash">2ece9ae</span>
        <span class="cl-date">2026-07-07</span>
        <span class="cl-msg"><strong>v1.1</strong> 6 章实战内容（不熟项目/多会话并行/时间管理/夜间异步/文档同步/基础设施）</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cl-item cl-current">
        <span class="cl-hash">5e8f0d9</span>
        <span class="cl-date">2026-07-07</span>
        <span class="cl-msg"><strong>v2.0</strong> 5 层金字塔重构 + 4 新页（ai-as-amplifier/first-task-sop/ai-boundaries/pilot-playbook）</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cl-item">
        <span class="cl-hash">HEAD</span>
        <span class="cl-date">2026-07-07</span>
        <span class="cl-msg"><strong>v2.1</strong> 终端化布局 + 试点踩坑实录</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sec-h3">// latest additions</h3>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <a href="/strategy/pilot-lessons" class="card">
        <div class="card-tag">strategy/</div>
        <h4>🔥 试点踩坑实录</h4>
        <p>3 个真实失败案例：跨第三方迁移崩盘 / AI 自信式完成 / 跨语言迁移。归因 + 7 条教训 + 现在的做法。</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/handbook/ai-as-amplifier" class="card">
        <div class="card-tag">handbook/</div>
        <h4>🧠 AI 是放大器</h4>
        <p>为什么判断力是 AI 产出的乘数因子。经验的价值不在于记 API，而在于判断力、地图、嗅觉、边界感。</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/research/ai-boundaries" class="card">
        <div class="card-tag">research/</div>
        <h4>📏 AI 能力边界</h4>
        <p>AI 真正擅长的 8 类任务 + 结构性做不到的 6 件事 + 4 级信心等级表。</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/handbook/first-task-sop" class="card">
        <div class="card-tag">handbook/</div>
        <h4>🚀 第一单 SOP</h4>
        <p>团队引入 AI 编程后第一个任务怎么跑。选任务 → 准备 → Kickoff → 执行 → 验证 → 复盘。</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/strategy/pilot-playbook" class="card">
        <div class="card-tag">strategy/</div>
        <h4>🏢 试点负责人 Playbook</h4>
        <p>选团队、评判断力、定指标、从试点到推广。给负责公司 AI 试点的人。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer CTA -->
  <section class="section cta">
    <h2 class="sec-h2"><span class="sec-bracket">[</span> cat ./README.md <span class="sec-bracket">]</span></h2>
    <pre class="readme-block">{`# AI Dev Handbook

这不是学术论文，是工程手册。
所有内容来自真实项目经验、行业调研和实证数据。
每个建议都经过生产环境验证。

## 入口
- 按角色路径：./read --role=&lt;pilot-lead|engineer|tech-lead|migrator&gt;
- 按内容树：./tree
- 按核心结论：./insights --top=8

## 仓库
git clone https://github.com/atbeta/ai-dev-handbook.git
`}</pre>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="#pyramid" class="btn-primary">tree →</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/atbeta/ai-dev-handbook" class="btn-secondary">git clone →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  /* ========== Status bar ========== */
  .statusbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: var(--c-bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .sb-item { white-space: nowrap; }
  .sb-sep { color: var(--c-text-muted); }
  .sb-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c-green);
    display: inline-block;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--c-green);
  }

  /* ========== Terminal hero ========== */
  .terminal-hero {
    background: #0a0e14;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .terminal-header {
    background: #1c2128;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  .term-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .term-red { background: #ff5f57; }
  .term-yellow { background: #febc2e; }
  .term-green { background: #28c840; }
  .term-title {
    margin-left: 12px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
  }
  .terminal-body {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    color: #c9d1d9;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .term-line { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .term-prompt { color: #58a6ff; margin-right: 8px; }
  .term-cmd { color: #c9d1d9; }
  .term-output { color: #8b949e; margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .term-log { font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .log-ok { color: #3fb950; }
  .log-warn { color: #d29922; }
  .term-em { color: #58a6ff; margin-top: 4px; }
  .ascii-art {
    color: #58a6ff;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 8px 0;
    white-space: pre;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* ========== Section headers ========== */
  .sec-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sec-h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sec-bracket { color: var(--c-accent); margin: 0 4px; }

  /* ========== Tree view ========== */
  .tree-view {
    background: var(--c-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }
  .tree-hint {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* ========== Insights grid ========== */
  .insights-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .insight-card {
    background: var(--c-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }
  .ic-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .ic-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ic-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    background: var(--c-bg-tertiary);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ic-body p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ========== Paths ========== */
  .paths {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .path {
    background: var(--c-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
  }
  .path-prompt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .path-flow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    padding-left: 16px;
  }
  .path-flow a {
    color: var(--c-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--c-accent);
  }
  .path-flow a:hover {
    color: #fff;
    border-bottom-color: #fff;
  }
  .arr {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    margin: 0 4px;
  }
  .path-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  /* ========== Changelog ========== */
  .changelog {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    background: var(--c-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
